Richard Cornwell, SimH i7010
  Read as a reference implementation. No code or tables are copied; the
  deliberate deviations from it are listed in oracle/simh-deviations.ts.

IBM manuals (via bitsavers.org)
  Cited by form number and page. No manual, scan or PDF is included. Short
  passages and tables are transcribed where the emulator is checked against
  them.

